From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pulsar Seat <pulsar-seat@invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:00:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] pulsar: seat control pipe and web UI switch

Adds pulsar_seat_id, pulsar_web_ui and pulsar_control_pipe. With a seat id the server creates \.\pipe\PulsarSplit\seat\<seat-id>\server (SYSTEM only, first instance, no remote clients) before any network listener and serves hello, status, pair.submit (with client name), pair.cancel, clients.*, apps.reload, session.close, server.shutdown and log.level; events pair.pending, pair.ended, stream.started, stream.ended, capture.error and audio.state. pulsar_web_ui = disabled never creates the HTTPS config server. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
